hadiths[20]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1651","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Zaid bin Aslam se, unhon ne Ansari Abdullah ke bete Jabir se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke hum Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke sath Banu Anmar ke ghazwe mein nikle. Jabir ne kaha ke main darakht ke neeche utra hua tha to achanak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam), to maine kaha ke ya Rasulullah saye ki taraf aaein. Unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) utre to main apni bori ki taraf khada hua aur is mein koi cheez talash ki aur is mein kakdi ka chhota paudha paya to use toda phir use Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke qareeb kya to Aap ne farmaya ke tumhare paas ye kahan se hai. Unhon ne kaha ke maine kaha ke hum use ya Rasulullah Madina se lekar nikle they. Jabir ne kaha ke hamare paas hamara sathi tha jise hum taiyar karte they jo jata tha aur hamari peeth charata tha. Unhon ne kaha ke maine use taiyar kya phir wo peeth par gaya jabke us par us ke do tehband they jo purane ho gae they. Unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne us ki taraf dekha aur farmaya ke kya is ke paas in dono ke ilawa do kapde nahi. To maine kaha ke kyun nahi ya Rasulullah, us ke paas thaili mein do kapde hain jo maine use pehnaye they. Aap ne farmaya ke use bulao aur use hukm do ke inhein pehne. Unhon ne kaha ke maine use bulaya aur us ne inhein pehna phir peeth pher kar gaya. Unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke use kya hai, Allah us ki gardan mare, kya ye us ke liye behtar nahi. Unhon ne kaha ke mard ne use suna aur kaha ke ya Rasulullah Allah ke raaste mein. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah ke raaste mein. Unhon ne kaha ke wo mard Allah ke raaste mein qatal kya gaya."
"1652","Mujhe Malik se riwayat kya ke unhein khabar pahunchi ke Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke main pasand karta hun ke safed kapdon wale qari ki taraf dekhun."
"1653","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Tamima ke bete Abi Tamima Ayyub se, unhon ne Sireen ke bete Ibn Sireen se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Umar bin Khattab ne kaha ke jab Allah tum par wusat kare to apne upar wusat karo, mard apne kapde jama kare."
"1654","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se riwayat kya ke Abdullah bin Umar mashq se range hue kapde aur zafran se range hue pehente they."
"1655","Yahya ne kaha ke maine Malik ko kehte suna ke main napasand karta hun ke ladke sone mein se koi cheez pehnein kyunke mujhe khabar pahunchi hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne sone ki anguthi se mana kya, to main ise bade aur chhote mardon ke liye makrooh samajhta hun. Yahya ne kaha ke maine Malik ko usfur se range hue kambalon ke bare mein kehte suna jo ghar walon ke liye gharon mein aur sehnon mein hon. Unhon ne kaha ke main is mein koi haram cheez nahi janta aur is ke ilawa libas mujhe zyada pasand hai."
"1656","Mujhe Malik ne Hisham bin Urwa se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha se riwayat kya ke unhon ne Zubair ke bete Abdullah ko khazz ka joola pehnaya jo Aaisha pehenti thin."
"1657","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Alqama ke bete Abi Alqama se, unhon ne apni walida se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Abdur Rahman ki beti Hafsa Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Aaisha ke paas dakhil huin jabke Hafsa par bareek dupatta tha to Aaisha ne use phaad diya aur unhein mota dupatta pehnaya."
"1658","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Maryam ke bete Abi Maryam Muslim se, unhon ne Saleh ke bete Abi Saleh se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke kapde pehenne wali nangi jhukne wali jhukane wali Jannat mein dakhil na hongi aur na us ki khushbu paeigi jabke us ki khushbu paanch sau saal ki musafat se pai jati hai."
"1659","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Yahya bin Saeed se, unhon ne Shihab ke bete Ibn Shihab se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat se khade hue aur aasman ke ufuq mein dekha aur farmaya ke aaj raat khazanon mein se kya khola gaya aur fitnon mein se kya wajeh hua, duniya mein kitni pehenne wali Qiyamat ke din nangi hogi, hujron waliyon ko jagao."
"1660","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Dinar ke bete Abdullah se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jo apna kapda takabbur se kheenche Allah Qiyamat ke din us ki taraf na dekhega."
"1661","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Zinad se, unhon ne Araj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Tabarak wa Taala Qiyamat ke din us ki taraf na dekhega jo apna tehband takabbur se kheenche."
"1662","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi aur Dinar ke bete Abdullah aur Zaid bin Aslam se riwayat kya, wo sab unhein Abdullah bin Umar se khabar dete they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke Allah Qiyamat ke din us ki taraf na dekhega jo apna kapda takabbur se kheenche."
"1663","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abdur Rahman ke bete Ala se, unhon ne apne walid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke maine Khudri ke bete Abi Saeed se tehband ke bare mein pucha to unhon ne kaha ke main tumhein ilm se khabar deta hun, maine Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko kehte suna ke momin ka tehband us ki dono pindliyon ke nisf tak hai, is mein us par koi gunah nahi jo is ke aur takhnon ke darmiyan ho, jo is se neeche ho wo aag mein hai, jo is se neeche ho wo aag mein hai, Allah Qiyamat ke din us ki taraf na dekhega jo apna tehband takabbur se kheenche."
"1664","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi ke bete Abu Bakr se, unhon ne apne walid Umar ke bete Ibn Umar ke azad karda Nafi se, unhon ne Ubaid ki beti Safiya bint Abi Ubaid se riwayat kya ke unhon ne unhein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zauja Umm Salma se khabar di ke unhon ne kaha ke jab tehband ka zikr kya gaya to aurat ya Rasulullah. Aap ne farmaya ke use balisht bhar latkae. Umm Salma ne kaha ke tab is se khul jaega. Aap ne farmaya ke haath bhar, is par zyada na kare."
"1665","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Zinad se, unhon ne Araj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke tum mein se koi aik jooti mein na chale, dono ko pehne ya dono ko utare."
"1666","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Zinad se, unhon ne Araj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke jab tum mein se koi joota pehne to daein se shuru kare aur jab utare to baein se shuru kare, aur daein in dono mein pehle pehni jae aur aakhir mein utari jae."
"1667","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne apne chacha Malik ke bete Abi Suhail se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Ahbar ke bete Kaab se riwayat kya ke mard ne apni jootiyan utarin to us ne kaha ke tum ne apni jootiyan kyun utarin, shayad tum ne is aayat ki taweel ki ke apni jootiyan utaro beshak tum Muqaddas waadi Tuwa mein ho. Unhon ne kaha ke phir Kaab ne mard se kaha ke kya tum jante ho ke Musa ki jootiyan kya thin. Malik ne kaha ke main nahi janta ke mard ne use kya jawab diya, to Kaab ne kaha ke wo mare hue gadhe ki khaal se thin."
"1668","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Abu Zinad se, unhon ne Araj se, unhon ne Abu Huraira se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne do libason aur do baion se mana kya, mulamasa aur munabaza se, aur is se ke mard aik kapde mein ghutne khade kare jabke us ki sharmgah par is mein se kuchh na ho, aur is se ke mard aik kapde ko apne aik pehlu par lapete."
"1669","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Nafi se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar se riwayat kya ke Umar bin Khattab ne resham ka joda dekha jo masjid ke darwaze ke paas becha ja raha tha to unhon ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah agar aap ye joda khareed lein aur use Juma ke din aur wafd ke liye pehnein jab wo aap ke paas aaein. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke ye to wo pehenta hai jis ka aakhirat mein koi hissa nahi. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ke paas is mein se jode aae to Umar bin Khattab ko is mein se joda diya to Umar ne kaha ke ya Rasulullah aap ne mujhe pehnaya jabke aap ne Atarid ke jode mein jo kaha kaha tha, to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ke maine tumhein is liye nahi pehnaya ke use pehno. To Umar ne use Makka mein apne mushrik bhai ko pehnaya."
"1670","Mujhe Malik se, unhon ne Talha ke bete Abdullah ke bete Ishaq se riwayat kya ke unhon ne kaha ke Anas bin Malik ne kaha ke maine Umar bin Khattab ko dekha jabke wo us din Madina ke ameer they aur un ke dono kandhon ke darmiyan teen paiband lage hue they, baaz baaz ke upar."
